WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:39.460
In the year 2009, humanity
encountered its first alien race.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.780
The result was an intergalactic war with a militaristic race of giants called Zentraedi.

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.240
The Earth was thrown into what
seemed a never-ending crisis.

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:51.430
In the year 2010, March,
the war was brought to an end.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:54.340
In April of the same year, the New Unity Government was established...

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:58.290
...calling together mankind and Zentraedi into peaceful co-existence.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:04.490
This resulted in a mass micronization of the remaining Zentraedi via the "Micron Process."

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:10.470
In September of 2011, the Unity Government devised a colonization plan...

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.890
...centered upon the preservation
of the human race.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:16.240
In September of the next year,
the first colonial transport...

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:18.000
...the Megaroad One
began its journey.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:23.870
In September of 2030, the first of the new Macross-class transports...

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:27.990
...a gigantic vessel dwarfing its
Megaroad predecessor, departed Earth.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.350
These ships could carry in
excess of one million people.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:39.130
In 2038, the 37th colonial expedition, the
7th Macross fleet, launched from Earth orbit.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.930
Its destination -- the Galactic Core.

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:44.510
It is now 2045...

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.190
I've never seen symptoms
like these before.

00:02:52.190 --> 00:02:54.510
At the moment,
there's no way to treat it.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.050
Why did you do that ?

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:57.870
It's something
I've wanted to do.

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:01.000
And what's that ?
What do you think singing is ?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.460
Singing is the burning
heart of passion !

00:03:04.010 --> 00:03:07.740
It can't be, they're...
Well, that couldn't possibly happen.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.100
What are you doing ?

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:15.340
Why won't you
give me an answer ?!

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.470
Twice...

00:03:37.470 --> 00:03:40.100
Twice in a row, they refused
to hear the entire song.

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.430
What's missing ?

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.640
What sound do I need to add
to reach into their hearts ?

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:18.920
FIRE SCRAMBLE

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:24.050
Alright ! Super Nova !
It's Super Nova !

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:36.540
Ray !
Aren't you up yet ?

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.290
We need to start
as soon as possible !

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.340
Are you nuts ?!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.560
Ray's room
is over there !

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:51.690
Hold on ! You're taking part
in Super Nova Live, right ?

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.240
Hurry up and get ready !

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.880
I don't want to go.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:59.940
You can't be serious !
It's Super Nova ! The Super Nova !

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:04.220
Queen & King and The Mosaic Band
debuted at this concert !

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:05.160
So what ?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.400
What's with this "so what" crud ?!
Don't you understand ?

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:13.840
It means Fire, us, finally have a shot to
prove to the world that we're real musicians !

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.940
What does that mean ?

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:18.090
"What's does that mean ?"
What's your problem ?!

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:20.570
Ray, talk to her.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.540
Good morning, Mylene.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.190
Ray !
Oh, you surprised me !

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.740
You surprised me, too.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:32.540
I thought this building was going to
fall apart from all your shouting.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.230
Because Super Nova's coming up !

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:37.750
It's the gateway to
success for new bands !

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.240
Would you knock it off ?!
You keep going on and on !

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.100
What's with you ?!

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.370
You're in
a bad mood, Basara.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:48.160
You really hate the idea of
bringing the Valkyrie, don't you ?

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:53.140
Oh, that thing ? Well, we had
to use it to get on the list.

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.140
It's not that.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:56.790
Then what is it ?!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.940
Is it your policy not to let somebody
tell you when or where to perform ?

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:02.130
That's right.

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:04.870
That's why I don't
sing when I don't want to.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.960
Basara, this is the song we'll
be playing. Take a look at it.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:09.890
You're persistent.

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:14.810
We'll be waiting for you. It's going to be held at Starry Sky Hall in Central City.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:20.720
By the way, I already had
your Valkyrie taken to the hall.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:24.300
What ?!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.990
How dare you !

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:37.190
Basara...

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:40.780
I don't think it'll be so
bad singing at Starry Sky Hall.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.690
See ya !
We'll meet you there !

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:01.050
Would you like
some juice ?

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:02.830
Juice ! Juice !

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:11.320
Juice ! Juice !
Tasty juice !

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:15.940
Good morning, everyone.

00:07:15.940 --> 00:07:19.790
Today we will be talking with the two leaders of City Seven to give us some perspective...

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.190
...on the recent alien attacks:

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:27.610
Captain Maximilian Jenius
and Mayor Miria Farina Jenius.

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:29.010
Well then...

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.650
Captain Maximilian, there's no question
that the military has managed...

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:31.550
Excuse me...
Captain Maximilian, there's no question
that the military has managed...

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:34.210
Captain Maximilian, there's no question
that the military has managed...

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:36.950
...to stave off the enemy for now
with our two major victories.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.250
That's correct.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:42.190
Unfortunately, we haven't been able
to identify the aliens as of yet.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:45.350
We will, however, continue to oppose
them with everything we've got.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:49.990
Why did you delay contacting City Hall
until after the battle was well under way ?

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.390
Without as much as a warning to us,
the military began its blasting...

00:07:54.390 --> 00:07:59.000
How come there's nothing
but junk on the news today ?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.590
I thought they'd show some footage
from the Queen & King concert !

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:06.690
The military has stated that they
were able to drive the enemy back...

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:10.290
...but I've been told that it has sustained
serious casualties in doing so.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:13.700
That's just
a farfetched rumor.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.330
Is it so farfetched ?
I've been told...

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.790
Alright...Alright...Alright...

00:08:17.790 --> 00:08:18.960
Stop !

00:08:19.650 --> 00:08:22.190
Akiko, are you sure about...

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:25.410
...inviting a bunch of unknowns to play at the Super Nova is a good idea ?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:27.790
Everybody here started
off as unknowns.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.250
Besides, this
Valkyrie is famous.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:33.040
I want you to
tell me the truth.

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.870
I am telling the truth.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:39.090
The families of the downed pilots have only been allowed to see them behind glass panels...

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:41.090
...and they haven't
been told anything.

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:42.390
Veffidas, good morning !

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:45.550
You want me to
calm down, even after...

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:48.500
Let me explain
this to you, Mayor Miria...

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.190
I guess it's a little difficult
for the citizens to understand...

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.790
...but military regulations...

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.590
Oh, not that again !
Military reg...

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.890
Mom and Dad
haven't changed a bit.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:09:02.080
Don't you have an obligation to inform us of the current condition of these soldiers ?

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:02.810
That's correct.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:06.240
...bass guitar of Mosaic,
they say.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:10.860
How sick.
Queen & King fans.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.550
Is this the right way
to the Hoshinote line ?

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:22.850
Asshole.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:23.650
Stop it !

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:29.340
You're the one that's been frightening the citizens with these unsubstantiated rumors.

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:31.240
Now tell me the truth !

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:34.180
I told you,
everything I've said is true.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.320
You really are a
hard nut to crack.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:39.280
And you're just as stubborn.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:43.280
What did you say ?! I'm going to hold you responsible for those words.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:46.170
You'll be just as responsible.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.890
What does that mean ?

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:52.590
So that's it. The Captain and the Mayor share completely opposite viewpoints.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:56.190
And it has apparently spread
into your private lives as well.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:10:00.190
The rumor is that the both
of you have formally divorced.

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:02.320
That's just a
groundless rumor !

00:10:02.320 --> 00:10:04.390
But, is this it
for City Seven...

00:10:04.390 --> 00:10:06.280
I guess I was right.

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:06.970
Yeah.

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:10.510
I'm sorry, but I have to
get back to the bridge.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.610
I have to leave as well.

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.340
Geez.
We missed the bus.

00:10:21.340 --> 00:10:26.020
Ain't our fault. Those Queen and King fans sure fucked up the air around here.

00:10:27.190 --> 00:10:29.190
Shut up !
That's it, asshole !

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:31.700
All you
do is raz us !

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:34.000
Like when ?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.240
What was all that shit about
us being out of whack ?!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:43.760
I mean, anyone who likes Queen and King
must be whacked in their minds.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:46.040
Mosaic's the
weakest band out...

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.910
Come on, everyone.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:49.040
Who are you ?

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.400
Fire Bomber.

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.230
Who ?

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.950
Maybe you haven't heard the name.
But does this sound familar ?

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.890
In this operation, our attack
party will split into two.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:08.250
One group will fold out at a range of 2,000 from the enemy ship.

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:10.250
That group will draw
their defenses away.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:18.140
When they engage and pursue, our main strikeforce will fold out above the mother ship.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:22.780
If all goes well, this operation will
hold until the guards return.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.800
One moment please, Lord Gepelnitch.
[Yes - Gepelnitch is really a guy!!]

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:30.520
I don't think we need
to resort to such ploys.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:34.030
Do you not like
my plan, Gigil ?

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:35.350
Not at all, m'lord !

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:36.990
Then execute it.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:37.840
Yes, sir !

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:01.960
Will Basara show up ?

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:02.590
I don't know.

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.610
Haven't all your
members arrived yet ?

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:08.480
If you want, we can arrange somebody to
take his place from another band.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.190
No way !

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:11.870
Anybody would work.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.030
What I'm saying is, everybody's going
to stare at the Valkyrie, not you.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:16.960
Wait a minute...!

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.940
Okay, I'll wait
just another hour.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:23.050
The other bands will just have to
perform ahead of you then.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.650
We'll get into trouble, Akiko !

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:29.160
Next time, you're cancelled if
you're late like this again.

00:12:29.160 --> 00:12:31.580
Alright.
I'll go look for him !

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.870
You've gotten much nicer
since last time we met.

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:39.490
I've changed a lot
since we were together.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:44.650
Geez !

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.760
You sonuva' bitch !
That's enough !

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:54.500
I hate your singing !

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:55.790
Basara !

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.950
Hey, knock it off !

00:12:57.950 --> 00:12:58.530
What ?!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.120
What are you doing ?!

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:05.200
Don't get in the way again,
you little bitch !

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.120
Oh, no ! Murderer !

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.090
I'll get you for
this, you shithead !

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:24.040
You're going
to pay for that !

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.550
Go to hell, asshole !

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.190
Basara...

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:33.100
Oh, my God...
I hit someone...

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:38.550
You idiot !
I hit them because of you !

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:42.210
I can't resort to force.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.730
I have to get through
to them with my song.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.410
What are you
talking about ?

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:48.180
Let's fuck him up.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:49.990
Let's kill him !

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:53.840
Get in !

00:13:53.840 --> 00:13:54.990
Okay !

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:56.640
What are you doing ?

00:14:03.990 --> 00:14:07.300
Man, I swear.
You're nothing but trouble.

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:12.380
Basara, did you look at the
song we're going to perform ?

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:13.410
Nope.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.890
You already tossed it ?

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.190
Here.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.550
I'm in no mood to
do this...Not today...

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:24.800
This is the one
I just composed.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.870
That's right.
It's our new song.

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:29.930
I practiced
real hard on it.

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:33.440
It's still a little rough,
but I think it's good.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.850
Captain on the bridge.

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:55.190
We've received word from
the rear ship, Doriboguld.

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:56.680
An enemy ship
has folded out.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.370
We've confirmed that it has launched assault craft, 2000 and closing.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.380
2000 ?

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:05.790
That's quite a distance from
where they usually come in.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:07.540
It might be a ploy.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.690
All right, put Diamond Force on standby.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:12.980
All rear interceptors,
lead them to sector GGR.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:21.390
It's that guy !

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.890
That's the bastard !

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:27.070
Next up is Fire Bomber !

00:15:28.290 --> 00:15:29.960
Everyone, listen
to my heart !

00:15:51.390 --> 00:16:03.240
If you become the wind,
I want to become the endless sky.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:06.240
We don't want to listen to your music !
If you become the wind,
I want to become the endless sky.

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:06.800
Get off !
If you become the wind,
I want to become the endless sky.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:07.170
If you become the wind,
I want to become the endless sky.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:08.760
Your music sucks !
If you become the wind,
I want to become the endless sky.

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:11.830
Put on Queen and King !

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:14.970
When I'm lost in...

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:19.470
New enemy ship sighted.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.480
Range 300.
It's launching assault craft.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:24.700
That must be their
main attack force.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:26.670
All right.
Diamond Force, takeoff !

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:32.120
Rear interceptors, Sky, Red, Orange,
head to Macross defensive sector T05...

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:36.640
Advanced defense
squadron Blue Zones....

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:46.900
Please follow all instructions and begin
making your way to the shelters.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:47.550
Ray...
Please follow all instructions and begin
making your way to the shelters.

00:16:47.550 --> 00:16:48.040
Please follow all instructions and begin
making your way to the shelters.

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.510
Patience !
Patience, please !

00:16:50.850 --> 00:16:53.590
This is so lame !

00:16:58.840 --> 00:16:59.940
Enemy contact.

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.120
Enter battle
in formation D !

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.690
They still hadn't launched
all their fighters ?

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:19.040
Shit. They figured
out our plan.

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.040
I didn't expect
Gepelnitch's plan to work.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.650
Calm down !
Don't rush !

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:41.650
Basara !

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:43.860
I'm going out for a while !

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:44.650
Basara !

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.730
I'll continue my
performance out there.

00:18:00.990 --> 00:18:03.780
He's doing something stupid !

00:18:03.780 --> 00:18:06.120
He must like
doing stupid things !

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.400
Too easy.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.340
Where the hell
are you going ?!

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:33.000
We have been so
ordered by Lord Gepelnitch.

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:34.960
Ordered by Gepelnitch ?

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:36.940
What does that mean ?

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.230
Change formation D to F !

00:18:41.230 --> 00:18:42.470
Surround the enemy leader !

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.540
These flies are
beginning to annoy me !

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:49.890
There he is again !

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:56.610
Third time's always a charm.
Be sure to listen !

00:19:00.540 --> 00:19:01.570
Here we go.

